{"id":80,"slug":"ma-jain-zh","resourceId":56,"nameNative":"马坚译（中文）","nameAr":"ما جيان","nameEn":"Chinese Translation (Ma Jian)","lang":"zh","source":"Quran.com API v4","sourceUrl":"https://quran.com","verses":[{"verseNumber":1,"verseKey":"80:1","text":"他曾皱眉，而且转身离去，"},{"verseNumber":2,"verseKey":"80:2","text":"因为那个盲人来到他的面前。"},{"verseNumber":3,"verseKey":"80:3","text":"你怎能知道呢？他也许能受薰陶，"},{"verseNumber":4,"verseKey":"80:4","text":"或听忠告，而蒙教益。"},{"verseNumber":5,"verseKey":"80:5","text":"至於自满者，"},{"verseNumber":6,"verseKey":"80:6","text":"你都逢迎他，"},{"verseNumber":7,"verseKey":"80:7","text":"他不受薰陶，於你何干？"},{"verseNumber":8,"verseKey":"80:8","text":"至於殷切地来请教你，"},{"verseNumber":9,"verseKey":"80:9","text":"而且心怀敬畏者，"},{"verseNumber":10,"verseKey":"80:10","text":"你却怠慢他。"},{"verseNumber":11,"verseKey":"80:11","text":"绝不然！这确是一种教训。"},{"verseNumber":12,"verseKey":"80:12","text":"谁欲记诵它，就叫谁记诵它吧。"},{"verseNumber":13,"verseKey":"80:13","text":"它在珍贵的册业里；"},{"verseNumber":14,"verseKey":"80:14","text":"那些册业，是被称扬的，是被涤净的，"},{"verseNumber":15,"verseKey":"80:15","text":"是在许多书记的手里的；"},{"verseNumber":16,"verseKey":"80:16","text":"那些书记，是尊贵的，是善良的。"},{"verseNumber":17,"verseKey":"80:17","text":"该死的人！他是何等的忘恩！"},{"verseNumber":18,"verseKey":"80:18","text":"真主曾用什么创造他的呢？"},{"verseNumber":19,"verseKey":"80:19","text":"是用精液。他曾创造他，并预定他发育的程序。"},{"verseNumber":20,"verseKey":"80:20","text":"然后，他使他的道路平易。"},{"verseNumber":21,"verseKey":"80:21","text":"然后，他使他死，并安葬他。"},{"verseNumber":22,"verseKey":"80:22","text":"然后，当他意欲的时候，他使他复活。"},{"verseNumber":23,"verseKey":"80:23","text":"绝不然，他还没有奉行他所命令他的事务。"},{"verseNumber":24,"verseKey":"80:24","text":"教人观察自己的食物吧！"},{"verseNumber":25,"verseKey":"80:25","text":"我将雨水大量地倾注下来。"},{"verseNumber":26,"verseKey":"80:26","text":"然后，我使地面奇异地裂开，"},{"verseNumber":27,"verseKey":"80:27","text":"我在大地上生产百谷，"},{"verseNumber":28,"verseKey":"80:28","text":"与葡萄和苜蓿，"},{"verseNumber":29,"verseKey":"80:29","text":"与橄榄和海枣，"},{"verseNumber":30,"verseKey":"80:30","text":"与茂密的园圃，"},{"verseNumber":31,"verseKey":"80:31","text":"水果和牧草，"},{"verseNumber":32,"verseKey":"80:32","text":"以供你们和你们的牲畜享受。"},{"verseNumber":33,"verseKey":"80:33","text":"当震耳欲聋的轰声来临的时候，"},{"verseNumber":34,"verseKey":"80:34","text":"在那日，各人将逃避自己的弟兄、"},{"verseNumber":35,"verseKey":"80:35","text":"自己的父母、"},{"verseNumber":36,"verseKey":"80:36","text":"自己的妻子儿女；"},{"verseNumber":37,"verseKey":"80:37","text":"在那日，各人将自顾不暇；"},{"verseNumber":38,"verseKey":"80:38","text":"在那日，许多面目是光华的，"},{"verseNumber":39,"verseKey":"80:39","text":"是喜笑的，是愉快的；"},{"verseNumber":40,"verseKey":"80:40","text":"在那日，许多面目上，将有灰尘，"},{"verseNumber":41,"verseKey":"80:41","text":"黧黑将蒙薇它。"},{"verseNumber":42,"verseKey":"80:42","text":"这等人，是不信道的，是荒淫的。"}]}